                "retweet_count": 21,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, in the House of Representatives, we unanimously passed three crucial pieces of legislation supporting our veterans and service members by providing financial assistance to disabled veterans, safeguarding tuition benefits, and ensuring that insurance coverage keeps up with inflation: \n- H.R. 877, the Deliver for Veterans Act\n- H.R. 983, the Montgomery GI Bill Selected Reserves Tuition Fairness Act \n- H.R. 970, the Fairness for Servicemembers and their Families Act\u00a0\n\nOne of my top priorities in Congress is honoring and serving those who courageously defended our nation to protect our freedom. We owe our veterans a debt of gratitude that can never truly be repaid, and it is our responsibility to ensure they receive the support they deserve and have earned.",
                "text_lang": "en",
