                "text": "Democrats are holding the government hostage\u2014hurting Americans to fund $1.5 TRILLION in partisan nonsense:\n\n\u274c $200B for illegal immigrants\u2019 healthcare\n\u274c Killing $50B for rural hospitals\n\u274c Endless COVID subsidies\n\u274c $500M for liberal media\n\u274c LGBTQ \u201cdemocracy\u201d grants in the Balkans\n\u274c Feminist \u201cprinciples\u201d in Africa\n\nAll that\u2019s missing is a $10 million study on the emotional well-being of climate-anxious penguins. \n\nUnserious demands from unserious people.",
